          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eshomo apa ninye tenebo Yoram olayioni le Ahab aarare Hasael olaiguanani le Siria te Ramot-Gilead nepuo iltung'ana le Siria aapik Yoram olbae teine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nerrinyunye olaiguanani Yoram metabaki te Yesreel, lelo baa lenyena ootipika iltung'ana le Siria te Ramot, ina kata apa pee earare Hasael olaiguanani le Siria. Nedoyio Ahasia olayioni le Yehoram, olaiguanani le Yuda alo adol Yoram olayioni le Ahab te Yesreel, amu kemuoi apa ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.29"
            ]
          }
        }
